{"4638610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tell Death We Live", "steam_appid": 4638610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4889670], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/c4c8efc9395703e7e7bc31732d6c8735.avif?t=1785892488\" width=551 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/c1a15982d6fcf059d893b269bec764ec.poster.avif?t=1785892488\" width=864 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/c1a15982d6fcf059d893b269bec764ec.webm?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/c1a15982d6fcf059d893b269bec764ec.mp4?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  For a thousand years, civilisations have fed themselves to the Anomaly, sending their people as sacrifice, as champions, as currency, just to slow the consumption. Empires built theologies around it. Factions went to war over it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> And yet, the Anomaly grows, its <i>hunger</i> continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/a15b476e00b94f2a7abdee4f65513c75.avif?t=1785892488\" width=504 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/6737cf6fe864fc5ec79cc3786985ca1a.poster.avif?t=1785892488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/6737cf6fe864fc5ec79cc3786985ca1a.webm?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/6737cf6fe864fc5ec79cc3786985ca1a.mp4?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inside, time pools. Technology fails. The relics of fallen Gods, fragments of their final moments, the last power they wielded before they died - scatter across killing floors and impossible geometry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">These are your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/ebbf199b4a4c6ff9d399a1b5bab9c424.avif?t=1785892488\" width=735 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/237c925cdc0c9663c6d929525e403b6e.poster.avif?t=1785892488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/237c925cdc0c9663c6d929525e403b6e.webm?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/237c925cdc0c9663c6d929525e403b6e.mp4?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your combatant. Enter the Anomaly. Build your deck from the shattered remains of divinity, master real-time defense when death comes for you, and push deeper than anyone has mapped. Because something survived inside. Something that was never supposed to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When you find it — tell death we live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/163b0fa86c655cff5c2521fabdd4cb08.poster.avif?t=1785892488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/163b0fa86c655cff5c2521fabdd4cb08.webm?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/163b0fa86c655cff5c2521fabdd4cb08.mp4?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/c4c8efc9395703e7e7bc31732d6c8735.avif?t=1785892488\" width=551 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/c1a15982d6fcf059d893b269bec764ec.poster.avif?t=1785892488\" width=864 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/c1a15982d6fcf059d893b269bec764ec.webm?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/c1a15982d6fcf059d893b269bec764ec.mp4?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  For a thousand years, civilisations have fed themselves to the Anomaly, sending their people as sacrifice, as champions, as currency, just to slow the consumption. Empires built theologies around it. Factions went to war over it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> And yet, the Anomaly grows, its <i>hunger</i> continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/a15b476e00b94f2a7abdee4f65513c75.avif?t=1785892488\" width=504 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/6737cf6fe864fc5ec79cc3786985ca1a.poster.avif?t=1785892488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/6737cf6fe864fc5ec79cc3786985ca1a.webm?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/6737cf6fe864fc5ec79cc3786985ca1a.mp4?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inside, time pools. Technology fails. The relics of fallen Gods, fragments of their final moments, the last power they wielded before they died - scatter across killing floors and impossible geometry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">These are your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/ebbf199b4a4c6ff9d399a1b5bab9c424.avif?t=1785892488\" width=735 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/237c925cdc0c9663c6d929525e403b6e.poster.avif?t=1785892488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/237c925cdc0c9663c6d929525e403b6e.webm?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/237c925cdc0c9663c6d929525e403b6e.mp4?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your combatant. Enter the Anomaly. Build your deck from the shattered remains of divinity, master real-time defense when death comes for you, and push deeper than anyone has mapped. Because something survived inside. Something that was never supposed to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When you find it — tell death we live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/163b0fa86c655cff5c2521fabdd4cb08.poster.avif?t=1785892488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/163b0fa86c655cff5c2521fabdd4cb08.webm?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/extras/163b0fa86c655cff5c2521fabdd4cb08.mp4?t=1785892488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The Gods are dead. The universe is dying. Survive and explore the anomaly in this story-rich, turn-based, RPG deck-builder, featuring real-time defensive mechanics and online co-operative play.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/588e7e8bfe69abb4d3dbf0b61ffafe2fa36b84be/header.jpg?t=1785892488", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/6a161551af4a7bf13b3315a5c5c125f7a249c2ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785892488", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638610/6a161551af4a7bf13b3315a5c5c125f7a249c2ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785892488", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7-8700K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT 6 GB / Intel Arc A380 6 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 55 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. Minimum specs allow for 1080p 30FPS low settings gameplay.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7-12700K / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti 8 GB / AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT 16 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 55 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. Recommended specs allow for 1080p 60FPS high settings gameplay.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirement